<import src="../../templates/common.wxml"/>
<view class="page" style="{{themeStyle}}"><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/>
<block wx:if="{{!loading&&!error}}"><view class="title">账号与隐私</view>
<view class="card"><view class="service-heading">{{club.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{club.supportContact}}" class="body-copy">客服：{{club.supportContact}}</view><view wx:if="{{club.legalEntity}}" class="small muted">{{club.legalEntity}}</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="menu-row" data-view="privacy" bindtap="toggleLegal"><text>隐私说明</text><text class="muted">查看 →</text></view><view class="menu-row" data-view="terms" bindtap="toggleLegal"><text>服务协议</text><text class="muted">查看 →</text></view><view class="menu-row"><text>版本</text><text class="muted">{{version}}</text></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{legalView}}" class="card body-copy" style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{legalView==='privacy'?club.privacyText:club.termsText}}</view>
<view class="section-title">关于</view><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="body-copy">这是虚构俱乐部预览，成员资料和服务价格为示例，预约不提供真实服务、不扣款。</view><view class="small muted">游戏图片和商标属于各自权利人，俱乐部与游戏发行商无关联。OpenNI 代码采用 MIT 协议，第三方游戏素材不在 MIT 授权范围内。</view><view class="section-title">账号管理</view><view class="body-copy muted">注销后会移除身份关联、联系方式与备注。未结束的预约和待结款项须先处理，必要的交易记录会匿名保留。</view>
<button class="button secondary page-bottom" bindtap="clearSession">退出当前会话</button><button class="button danger page-bottom" bindtap="deleteAccount" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{deleting}}">注销账号</button><view wx:if="{{accountMessage}}" class="notice">{{accountMessage}}</view></block></view>
